<title>UK: UK's UDO sees profits above expectations.</title>
<headline>UK's UDO sees profits above expectations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British reprographics services provider UDO Holdings Plc said on Friday it expected its pre-tax profits for the year to July 31 to exceed current market expectations.</p>
<p>UDO said its results would be similar to what was achieved the previous year.</p>
<p>The company also said it was planning to return at least 10 million stg to its shareholders, the details of which would be announced later.</p>
<p>UDO's share price was marked 13-1/2 pence higher at 131 within minutes after its announcement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
